LZ4
---

src/ManagedCompressions.Lz4 implements the LZ4 block format
(https://github.com/lz4/lz4/blob/dev/doc/lz4_Block_format.md). Its decoder is
its own. Its compressors reproduce lz4's (lib/lz4.c and lib/lz4hc.c), so that
both write the same blocks at every level; that part is derived from lz4 1.10.0
and remains under its license, BSD-2-Clause for lz4's lib directory, whose
