Brotli
------

src/ManagedCompressions.Brotli is an independent implementation of the Brotli
format (RFC 7932). Its decoder accepts and refuses the streams brotli 1.1.1's
decoder does (https://github.com/google/brotli). Its tables, the static
dictionary, the word transforms, the context lookup and the command codes, are
generated from brotli 1.1.1's sources (tools/brotli/generate-tables.cs), and
remain under brotli's license, quoted below.

ManagedCompressions.Brotli's tests read brotli's test data (tests/testdata at
tag v1.1.1), which tools/native-ref/brotli-testdata.sh writes. The repository
does not distribute it; it remains under brotli's license.

